  "bitrateRecommenderDetails": "Analyzes movement and visual complexity to recommend the bitrate for each scene. This helps preserve detail where the video needs it.",
  "sceneKeyframeDetails": "Detects scene changes and camera cuts, then places keyframes at useful points. This keeps seeking through the video smooth and responsive.",
  "noiseReductionDetails": "Reduces grain in low-light footage before compression. Cleaner footage can look clearer and may produce a smaller output file.",
  "silentAudioDetails": "Finds quiet sections in the audio track and trims them. This removes audio data that does not add useful sound.",
  "facePriorityDetails": "Detects people and faces in the video. Compression then preserves more visual detail around those subjects.",
  "batterySaverDetails": "Reduces intensive model processing when the battery is low. This helps extend device runtime during demanding tasks.",
  "streamTextDetails": "Displays the assistant response as it is generated. You can begin reading before the complete response is ready.",
  "showReasoningDetails": "Shows extra reasoning details in chat responses when the selected model provides them. It may make responses longer and more detailed.",
  "analyzeThumbnailsDetails": "Samples video frames to recognize scenes, activities, and lighting. This gives the assistant visual context about the selected video.",
  "samplingDensityDetails": "Choose how many frames are checked each second. Higher sampling can capture more scene changes and requires more processing.",
  "speechToTextDetails": "Processes the selected video audio on this device and turns spoken words into text. The resulting text can support subtitles and search.",
  "spokenLanguageDetails": "Identifies the language spoken in the audio. The detected language helps choose suitable transcription settings.",
  "semanticSearchDetails": "Builds a meaning-based search index stored on this device. You can use descriptions such as “beach at sunset” to find matching videos.",
  "indexChargingDetails": "Waits until the device is connected to power before generating search data. This reduces indexing activity while using battery power.",
  "directTrimmingDetails": "Lets the assistant trim video clips without re-encoding the video. This is faster and preserves the original video quality.",
  "audioExtractionDetails": "Lets the assistant export a video’s audio track as a separate audio file. The video itself is not re-encoded.",
  "metadataScrubberDetails": "Removes personal metadata such as EXIF details and GPS location from media. This helps protect information before sharing files.",
  "requireConfirmationDetails": "Asks for your approval before the assistant changes files. You can review actions that overwrite, save, or delete content.",
